  {
    "id": "ef82189b13cd6b838a56",
    "source": "A whole workshop can be cloned from the shelf or the hub, and individual pieces (maps, NPCs, monsters, encounters, tables, lore) each have a duplicate action, for the version-two-of-this-boss workflow. Hand-built monsters, items, spells and options belong to your account rather than to any one workshop, so they follow you into every workshop. They travel too: a bundle carries your whole homebrew shelf or only what the workshop uses, and a campaign that brings prep in gets its own copy of the monsters and items it uses.",
    "sourceHash": "ef82189b13cd6b838a5651b960222a9520f66ccbdd808dd67165e4c56f557d38",
